      "originalText": "#8) 334\nIncreasing Triplet Subsequence [Medium]\nDetermine whether increasing subsequence of length 3 exists.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QufhYHEpqYM0dfRlpua2S",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260.2450587224215,
      "y": 3896.2170275680483,
      "width": 518.0596313476562,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b00",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 563982430,
      "version": 721,
      "versionNonce": 1540367582,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781625276932,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Input: nums = [1,2,3,4,5]\nOutput: true\nExplanation: Any triplet where i < j < k is valid.\n---\nInput: nums = [5,4,3,2,1]\nOutput: false\nExplanation: No triplet exists.\n---\nInput: nums = [2,1,5,0,4,6]\nOutput: true\nExplanation: One of the valid triplet is (1, 4, 5), \nbecause nums[1] == 1 < nums[4] == 4 < nums[5] == 6.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Input: nums = [1,2,3,4,5]\nOutput: true\nExplanation: Any triplet where i < j < k is valid.\n---\nInput: nums = [5,4,3,2,1]\nOutput: false\nExplanation: No triplet exists.\n---\nInput: nums = [2,1,5,0,4,6]\nOutput: true\nExplanation: One of the valid triplet is (1, 4, 5), \nbecause nums[1] == 1 < nums[4] == 4 < nums[5] == 6.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
