      "text": "#9) 443 \nString Compression [Medium] \nCompress repeated characters in-place.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "#9) 443 \nString Compression [Medium] \nCompress repeated characters in-place.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BeT1oo8m8jR-5tc8y8WMi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 269.2450587224215,
      "y": 4399.217027568049,
      "width": 946.6192626953125,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b07",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1419964418,
      "version": 887,
      "versionNonce": 1727087554,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781625621933,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Input: chars = [\"a\",\"a\",\"b\",\"b\",\"c\",\"c\",\"c\"]\nOutput: 6\nExplanation: The groups are \"aa\", \"bb\", and \"ccc\". \nThis compresses to \"a2b2c3\".\nAfter modifying the input array in-place, \nthe first 6 characters of chars should be \n[\"a\",\"2\",\"b\",\"2\",\"c\",\"3\"].\n---\nInput: chars = [\"a\"]\nOutput: 1\nExplanation: The only group is \"a\", \nwhich remains uncompressed \nsince it is a single character.\nAfter modifying the input array in-place, \nthe first character of chars should be [\"a\"].\n---\nInput: chars = [\"a\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\"]\nOutput: 4\nExplanation: The groups are \"a\" and \"bbbbbbbbbbbb\". This compresses to \"ab12\".\nAfter modifying the input array in-place, the first 4 characters of chars should be [\"a\",\"b\",\"1\",\"2\"].",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Input: chars = [\"a\",\"a\",\"b\",\"b\",\"c\",\"c\",\"c\"]\nOutput: 6\nExplanation: The groups are \"aa\", \"bb\", and \"ccc\". \nThis compresses to \"a2b2c3\".\nAfter modifying the input array in-place, \nthe first 6 characters of chars should be \n[\"a\",\"2\",\"b\",\"2\",\"c\",\"3\"].\n---\nInput: chars = [\"a\"]\nOutput: 1\nExplanation: The only group is \"a\", \nwhich remains uncompressed \nsince it is a single character.\nAfter modifying the input array in-place, \nthe first character of chars should be [\"a\"].\n---\nInput: chars = [\"a\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\",\"b\"]\nOutput: 4\nExplanation: The groups are \"a\" and \"bbbbbbbbbbbb\". This compresses to \"ab12\".\nAfter modifying the input array in-place, the first 4 characters of chars should be [\"a\",\"b\",\"1\",\"2\"].",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
